# =========================================================
# Add-Ons - Vault : .gitignore
# =========================================================
# Rule: exclude ANY folder (at any depth) whose name starts
# with an underscore — e.g. _release_bundles, __VAULT,
# _media_assets, _releases, etc. (personal archives)
# =========================================================

_*/

# =========================================================
# EXCEPTION: __enhancements folders contain real pack files
# (not media/release junk), so explicitly un-ignore them
# even though they start with underscores.
# =========================================================

!__enhancements/
!__enhancements/**

# =========================================================
# Optional: common OS / editor clutter (safe to keep even
# on a public repo). Remove this section if not wanted.
# =========================================================

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.tmp
*.bak
